  "note": "[H] uses (12.8) only in the proof of Prop 12.2.4, where with (12.11) it bounds err_{q,R} from above; this gives (12.27)–(12.28), an upper bound on sq, and the constant c_{ρ,2}. The Lean proof never bounds G from above in this way: it uses regionL and regionS for q ≥ 2.2·10¹⁰ and a Φ-reduction with kernel checks below that."
